WEBVTT

00:00:00.369 --> 00:00:08.625
Marketing holds your campaigns, and your brand voice for everything AI writes. In this video, you’ll plan a campaign’s posts with AI.

00:00:09.649 --> 00:00:14.108
Open Marketing. Campaigns are planned, live, or ended, from their dates.

00:00:15.127 --> 00:00:22.807
A campaign has a goal, dates, locations, channels, a budget, a promo code, and a link tag, with all its posts in one place.

00:00:23.825 --> 00:00:28.497
Plan posts with AI drafts the campaign’s posts for you, to check and schedule.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:38.671
In Brand and settings, describe your business, your customers, your tone, and the words to use and avoid. AI reads it every time it writes for you.
